#
# Counter-example for the math:Cell frame: a math:Cell with NO math:cellDimension,
# so validation MUST emit shacl.QualifiedMinCountConstraintComponent (and no other
# finding), isolating math:IncompleteCell. Bound by ex:ecCellNoDimension.

@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:undimensionedCell a math:Cell .
